6. Input Requirements

The system may accept:

Story idea/prompt

Genre

Character details

Setting

Number of panels

Story tone

Dialogue preferences

User editing instructions


Example Input

> “Create a 6-panel superhero comic about a student who discovers a mysterious power.”




---

7. Output Requirements

The system generates:

Story title

Complete story

Character descriptions

Scene descriptions

Panel-by-panel content

Character dialogues

Narration/captions

AI prompts for comic visuals

Final comic preview

Exportable comic file



