8. System Actors

User

Registers/logs in

Enters prompts

Generates stories

Edits comics

Saves and exports comics


Gemini AI

Processes prompts

Generates story content

Creates characters and dialogues

Converts stories into panel descriptions


Administrator

Manages users

Monitors system performance

Manages application data and configuration



---

9. Main System Flow

User → Enter Story Idea → ComicCraft → Gemini API → Generate Story → Divide into Panels → Edit/Preview → Save → Export Comic

10. Project Objective

The main objective of ComicCraft is to simplify comic creation by combining generative AI and comic storytelling, allowing users to transform a simple idea into a structured comic without requiring professional writing or comic-design skills.
